{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼、唔呼、唔呼呼呼……♪」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "mc0294", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，那是怎樣？」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "ht0580", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什麼怎樣？」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「萬智老師啦，萬智老師。最近，她總是一個人莫名其妙地賊笑。」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "ht0581", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該不會是交到男朋友了？」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也這樣猜。如果真的是這樣，大家要祝福她才行。」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "ht0582", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以這時候就需要你了，新吾。」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "ht0583", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哇，又丟事情給我了。」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「別這樣說嘛。你去問萬智老師確認真相。這樣大家都能幸福了。」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "ht0584", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……果然又變成這樣。」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太拍拍我的肩膀，把我推向萬智老師。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼……呼呼、唔呼呼♪」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "mc0295", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我忍不住回頭看隼太，露出「沒問題嗎？」的表情。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "萬智老師看著手裡的照片，非常快樂的樣子。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "果然是交到男朋友了吧。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個……萬智老師，妳是不是發生什麼好事了？」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，你問得非常好，新吾君……」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "mc0296", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被她用閃閃發亮的雙眼注視，我有點招架不住。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來她是一直在等著有誰來問她……", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「老師好像很快樂的樣子。」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，古德利安太可愛了♪」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "mc0297", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「古德利安？」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是貓啦，貓。我開始養小貓了。那孩子的名字就叫做古德利安。」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "mc0298", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這就是所謂的可愛到要融化的孩子啊。」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "mc0299", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是第一次養貓，沒想到居然會這麼可愛……」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "mc0300", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我還幫牠買了衣服喔♪因為太可愛了，不管穿什麼都好適合～」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "mc0301", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，下次要買什麼衣服給牠穿呢？唔呼呼、唔呼呼呼♪」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 343, "voice": "mc0302", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，看來要無視她會比較好。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "萬智老師覺得幸福的話，這樣也好。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身為學生的我們沒有多嘴的餘地。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……她是末期了吧。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 350, "voice": "ht0585", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就說不要多嘴了！", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼嗯，八塚老師啊……」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "ar4371", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我懂她的心情。」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "sk1310", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃也喜歡貓嗎？」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "ar4372", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我喜歡動物。」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "sk1311", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那哥哥呢？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "ar4373", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學，我不懂妳這個問題的意思。」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喜歡動物。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "sk1312", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，我也不懂妳這個回答的意思。」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃學妹喜歡Animal的新吾同學呢。」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "ag3423", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也不懂特地用英文說動物這個詞的意義在哪……」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果男人能絕種就好了。」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sn1311", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這個人的內心是我最不懂的。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "得出這個結論，我好難過。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊，妳覺得動物性的男人怎麼樣呢？」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sn1312", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「動物性的男人？」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "mu1243", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是像這個新吾一樣，一年到頭都在發情，隨時隨地都可以開始交配的男人。」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sn1313", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我未免也被說得太差勁了吧。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身為男人，我也討厭那樣動物性的人。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……但是新吾君不是那種隨時隨地就交配的人吧？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "mu1244", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "聽到學姊口中說出「交配」這個詞，我心臟猛然一跳。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，這個男人絕對到處交配。隨時隨地、誰都可以。」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sn1314", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……紗凪說出交配這個詞倒是沒什麼違和感。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "同樣都是女孩子，還真是不可思議。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哥哥沒有被交配過。」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "sk1313", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是『被』也太慘了……」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "ar4374", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「交配這種事，清純的少女是不能說的。交配這種事……交配這種事！」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 325, "voice": "ag3424", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先不要去理說得比誰都開心的安潔吧。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想拒絕Animal新吾這個稱號。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂，Animal。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sn1315", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像不行。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我說你啊，就算不是有意的也不准幻想跟美羽學姊交配喔！」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sn1316", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了好了，到此為止。這種話對美羽學姊也很失禮吧？」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼，不要以為這樣說我就會上當。我可是知道的！」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sn1317", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「男人和母的在密室裡兩人獨處的時候，野性就會覺醒變得沒有分寸。」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sn1318", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她這種偏見到底是從哪裡學來的。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且還說母的……", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊也請小心點喔。Animal新吾絕對在打妳的主意！」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sn1319", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我實在不想從此就被叫這個綽號。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，新吾君才不是那樣的人呢對吧～？」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "mu1245", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「老實說，我不知道該怎麼回答。」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然是我個人的印象，但新吾君好像會非常溫柔地交配呢♪」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "mu1246", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;「噗！？」", "text_idx": 8, "plain": "「噗！？」", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "又說這種讓我無法回答的話。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "由美羽學姊說出口的「交配」太寫實了……", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……天羽學姊，不要一直說交配這個詞比較好。」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 328, "voice": "ar4375", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊，說的也是。交配是不能說也不能做的呢。」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 340, "voice": "mu1247", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥的交配很溫柔嗎？」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "sk1314", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃妳不要對奇怪的事情產生興趣。」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我正值這個年紀。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "sk1315", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算正值這個年紀也請自重。」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 333, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 336, "voice": "sk1316", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 339, "voice": "sn1320", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
